# Line endings: the repo is LF (CI runs on Linux and several tests compare
# fixtures byte-for-byte). A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true turned
# every text file into CRLF and made those tests red on the dev box only.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.wav binary
*.bin binary
*.npz binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.jar binary
